<section class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Voter register</p><h1>Students</h1><p class="muted">Only eligible students can be verified at the voting station.</p></div><div class="quick-actions"><a class="button button-secondary" href="/students/import">Import CSV</a></div></section>
